    "function": {
     "name": "submit_design",
     "arguments": "{\"note\":\"Review correction: this is NOT a verified, print-and-use fit. The clamp dimensions, bolt head size, and bolt length were never supplied, so the earlier Arca-style dimensions were guesses. Angled jaws alone do not establish that the clamp is Arca-compatible. Print this only after matching the rail parameters to the actual clamp and the pocket to the actual metal bolt; test the plate in the clamp with no camera. If you cannot measure the clamp and bolt, do not use this design to support a camera. Do not print a plastic screw: use only a suitable metal 1/4-20 bolt, confirm it threads freely and cannot bottom out. Even when fitted, use only as a stationary, light-duty temporary mount, with a hand supporting the camera; never carry it on the tripod or use it over people/valuable equipment. PLA can crack or creep.\",\"params\":{\"plate_length_mm\":{\"kind\":\"world\",\"value\":60,\"source\":\"guessed\",\"note\":\"Unverified starting value. Must match the clamp's front-to-back engagement length.\"},\"plate_top_width_mm\":{\"kind\":\"world\",\"value\":40,\"source\":\"guessed\",\"note\":\"Unverified deck width; ensure it clears the clamp body.\"},\"rail_bottom_width_mm\":{\"kind\":\"world\",\"value\":34,\"source\":\"guessed\",\"note\":\"Unverified narrow rail width; measure the clamp lips before printing.\"},\"rail_top_width_mm\":{\"kind\":\"world\",\"value\":38,\"source\":\"guessed\",\"note\":\"Unverified upper dovetail width; measure the clamp lips before printing.\"},\"rail_height_mm\":{\"kind\":\"world\",\"value\":4.5,\"source\":\"guessed\",\"note\":\"Unverified engagement height.\"},\"deck_thickness_mm\":{\"kind\":\"design\",\"value\":5,\"source\":\"design\",\"note\":\"Thicker camera-support deck than the prior draft, to leave more material above the bolt-head pocket.\"},\"bolt_clearance_d_mm\":{\"kind\":\"hardware\",\"value\":6.8,\"source\":\"design\",\"note\":\"Designed clearance for a 1/4-20 bolt shank; verify against the actual salvaged bolt.\"},\"bolt_head_pocket_width_mm\":{\"kind\":\"hardware\",\"value\":22,\"source\":\"guessed\",\"note\":\"Unverified estimated pocket width; measure the salvaged bolt head.\"},\"bolt_head_pocket_length_mm\":{\"kind\":\"hardware\",\"value\":26,\"source\":\"guessed\",\"note\":\"Unverified estimated pocket length; adjust to the bolt head and positioning needed.\"},\"bolt_head_pocket_depth_mm\":{\"kind\":\"hardware\",\"value\":4.5,\"source\":\"guessed\",\"note\":\"Unverified estimated bolt-head thickness; measure it and keep pocket depth below total plate thickness.\"},\"bolt_slot_length_mm\":{\"kind\":\"design\",\"value\":30,\"source\":\"design\",\"note\":\"Through-slot length for fore/aft positioning.\"},\"pocket_clearance_mm\":{\"kind\":\"design\",\"value\":0.6,\"source\":\"design\",\"note\":\"Nominal clearance around the measured bolt head; adjust for the printer and bolt.\"}},\"parts\":[{\"id\":\"plate\",\"role\":\"final\",\"material\":\"PLA (high-speed PLA, black)\",\"code\":\"def build(p):\\n    rail = (cq.Workplane('XY').rect(p.rail_bottom_width_mm, p.plate_length_mm)\\n            .workplane(offset=p.rail_height_mm)\\n            .rect(p.rail_top_width_mm, p.plate_length_mm).loft(combine=True))\\n    deck = (cq.Workplane('XY').box(p.plate_top_width_mm, p.plate_length_mm,\\n            p.deck_thickness_mm, centered=(True, True, False))\\n            .translate((0, 0, p.rail_height_mm)))\\n    part = rail.union(deck)\\n    total_h = p.rail_height_mm + p.deck_thickness_mm\\n    def slot_solid(width, length, z0, depth):\\n        r = width / 2.0\\n        straight = max(0.01, length - width)\\n        cut = (cq.Workplane('XY').box(width, straight, depth,\\n               centered=(True, True, False)).translate((0, 0, z0)))\\n        for y in (-straight / 2.0, straight / 2.0):\\n            end = cq.Workplane('XY').circle(r).extrude(depth).translate((0, y, z0))\\n            cut = cut.union(end)\\n        return cut\\n    through = slot_solid(p.bolt_clearance_d_mm, p.bolt_slot_length_mm,\\n                         -0.2, total_h + 0.4)\\n    pocket_w = p.bolt_head_pocket_width_mm + 2 * p.pocket_clearance_mm\\n    pocket_l = p.bolt_head_pocket_length_mm + 2 * p.pocket_clearance_mm\\n    pocket = slot_solid(pocket_w, pocket_l, -0.1,\\n                        p.bolt_head_pocket_depth_mm + 0.1)\\n    return part.cut(through).cut(pocket)\\n\",\"print_orientation\":\"Print with the narrow rail bottoms on the bed (z=0), and the camera-support deck upward. No supports intended; the bolt-head pocket roof spans approximately 23 mm at the guessed dimensions.\",\"use_orientation\":\"The tapered rails engage the tripod clamp lips only if their measured geometry matches. The flat deck faces the camera; a suitable metal 1/4-20 bolt passes from the underside through the slot into the camera socket.\"}],\"hardware\":[{\"id\":\"webcam_bolt\",\"ref\":\"salvaged:webcam-mount-bolt\",\"qty\":1}],\"criteria\":[{\"id\":\"rail-fit\",\"part\":\"plate\",\"feature\":\"tapered side rails\",\"relation\":\"engages\",\"check\":{\"method\":\"measure\",\"description\":\"Before mounting a camera, measure the clamp and verify the rails physically fit. Test with no camera: the plate must drop in without force, sit fully down, and be securely retained by the tightened jaws without rocking.\"}},{\"id\":\"bolt-fit\",\"part\":\"plate\",\"feature\":\"through-slot and underside head pocket\",\"relation\":\"clears\",\"hardware\":\"webcam_bolt\",\"clearance_mm\":0.6,\"check\":{\"method\":\"measure\",\"description\":\"Measure the actual bolt head and shank, then verify fit in the pocket/slot. Confirm the bolt threads freely into the camera and does not bottom out.\"}}],\"manual\":[{\"n\":\"1\",\"text\":\"Before printing, measure the clamp's engagement width, length, lip profile, and depth, plus the salvaged bolt's head and shank. The included Arca-style values are guesses, not measured dimensions; change the parameters to match your specific parts.\",\"parts\":[\"plate\"],\"hardware\":[\"webcam_bolt\"]},{\"n\":\"2\",\"text\":\"Print the plate and test it in the open clamp without a camera. It must drop in without force and be retained securely without rocking. If it does not, adjust the rail dimensions and reprint; do not force the clamp.\",\"parts\":[\"plate\"]},{\"n\":\"3\",\"text\":\"Verify the metal bolt fits the pocket and threads into the camera socket by hand. Check that it cannot bottom out. Tighten only gently.\",\"parts\":[\"plate\"],\"hardware\":[\"webcam_bolt\"],\"tool\":\"hand screwdriver, if needed\"},{\"n\":\"4\",\"text\":\"Treat it only as a stationary, light-duty temporary mount. Keep a hand supporting the camera; do not carry it on the tripod or use it above people or valuable equipment.\",\"parts\":[\"plate\"]}]}"
    }
